[
  {
    tag: "game",
    schema: 0.1,
    title: _("Final Departure"),
    children: [
      {
        tag: "map",
        id: "scenario_03x_Final_Departure",
        file: "winds-of-fate-03x.generated.map",
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "carryover_3",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "carryover_percentage",
            value: 40,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_4",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/inferno.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Dominant Vladnir, I can no longer remain in this land as your ally. I seek your forgiveness."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_5",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/warden.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ There is nothing for me to forgive. The Spoken Memories of the glider caste have pointed your course. There is no better heading I may counsel."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_6",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/inferno.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ ... I never suspected you held the gliders in such esteem. That you had heard the Spoken Memories. Perhaps glider wisdom overlaps the many written Secrets your own caste wards."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_7",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/warden.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ I am forbidden to tell. The Gliders may share their Memories. We Clashers must keep our Secrets. Yet I may say this... Your glider first intendant is well chosen for the journey ahead of you."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_8",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/warden.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Many matters are now in motion. I go now, for there are preparations to be made... <i>May your fire light the way in darkness.</i>"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_9",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/inferno.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ <i>May your ancestors tread beside you.</i>"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_10",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/hurricane.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ My Dominant Gorlack, your flight has assembled upon the eastern landing."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_11",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/inferno.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ There is no need for you to address me by status, Resha. We are still equals regardless of rank."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_12",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/hurricane.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ My friend, we are not equals, for I owe you my life. I would have perished in that cave if not for your intervention."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_13",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/inferno.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ ........."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_14",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/hurricane.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Gorlack... There is a matter for which I must give counsel. You have heard the Memory of our ancient exile to these sinking isles. You have endured the shame of knowing it was Dominant Morogor’s betrayal that made it so. While the rest of your caste revere this Ancestor, you alone shoulder the truth."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_15",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/inferno.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Verily, it has cooled my heart some, to know our shameful past. Yet such is a small price for wisdom."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_16",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/hurricane.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ My friend, the price is yet to be paid. Beyond these isles is a world stranger than words can tell. Things forgotten since the Time of Legend. When planted are our feet on the Greatland, that place which slew so many of our folk long ago... We must proceed with the utmost caution. With our Windpath well chosen."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_17",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/inferno.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ I hear your counsel, Resha. I shall heed it. Yet set aside your fear, for there is also more to us than words can tell. A power within our hearts to which you will bear witness. With it we shall part the turbulent Winds of Fate themselves. Leaving in their place, a Windpath of our own making."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "objectives",
        side: 1,
        victory: _(""),
        defeat: _(""),
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_1",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_2",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
    ],
  },
]
